Subject: [PATCH] Resolve SSH terminal and keyboard appearance together
SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
Base: lollipopkit/flutter_server_box fa7941a0b3d4dda154cbf85b007dc6348812e679
Compatible: e0347a02f5ca60edf1d635a158c6ba162aef7e76

Keep the terminal's logical theme and actual canvas in sync. Use the same
appearance for both SSH hosts and their keys. The optional SSH image still
uses its configured opacity; the virtual keys get a solid terminal surface.

